{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/pmkxc8","slideIndex":0,"text":"Prototype evaluation figures and doctor quotation provided by user. Raw test records, denominators and evaluation procedures not supplied; do not treat as independently validated clinical performance. Reported scope: 20+ synthetic handwritten and printed ANC images; 15 ANC RAG scenarios; three intentionally tested conflict types detected; automated MoHFW protocol checks. 100% conflict detection refers only to tested types, not all possible conflicts. Extraction accuracy 85-92%, template match 80%, false doctor referral under 5%, and data-entry time reduction 87% are reported figures. Quote is unverified user-supplied feedback, with no clinician identity or endorsement credentials asserted. Improvement items: manual emergency danger signs, confidence badges, routine nurse clicks reduced 12 to 3. Limitations: faded documents, pregnancy-only knowledge base, no real PHC-scale testing."}